This licence covers the source code in this repository and nothing else.

`Moonstone: A Hard Days Knight` is the property of its rights holders. This
repository contains none of that game: no artwork, no audio, no level data and
no code from it. What it contains is an independent reimplementation, written
from measurements of file formats and from the published game's own behaviour.

Running it requires a copy of the original that you already own. The engine
reads that copy on your own machine and converts it there. Nothing derived from
it is redistributed by this project, and `.gitignore` is written to keep it that
way.
